cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "Kavosh: exact enumeration and statistical evaluation of network motifs"
abstract: >-
  Kavosh enumerates every connected sub-graph of a given size in a network,
  classifies them into isomorphism classes using nauty, and scores each class
  against a degree-preserving random ensemble to identify network motifs.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/shmohammadi86/Kavosh"
